e before this can be approved, if anything. -->","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":25,"totalLines":25,"truncated":false}},"title":"docs/jobs/dozen_change-config-structure-for-mg-serve/verdict.md","time":{"start":1787938514030,"end":1787938514040}},"id":"prt_04970a3cc001d6C0WjejdxbZoU","sessionID":"ses_fb68f715dffenWbrsP50CKBzBA","messageID":"msg_049709921001FUKi0KqzTXNPEM"}}
